fcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-28T14:47:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T21:09:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nEvery Godot version that launches the XR server triggers the XRServer to do expensive work, even if there are not XR interfaces available, burning CPU.\n\nThis is part of my investigation of why Godot was missing update frames on MacOS, despite doing nothing: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3973954492\n\nXRServer is not really my domain of expertise, but I would think that we should not really run any XR steps if there are no XR devices active:\n\nthis is called from Main iteration:\n\n>\tXRServer::get_singleton()->_process();\n\nMeasured in Rocket Chat thread as consuming 3% of CPU when idling: https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/apple?msg=zyz8Ey4X4qMmGM4xG\n\n### System information\n\nAny platforms.\n\n### Issue description\n\nCPU being burned.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nStart Godot with any empty project, sit idling, and run a profiler, you will see XRServer consuming plenty of CPU.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny empty project will do.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116894/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}